  "tip": "<p>Estimate growth first and translate it into compute, memory, and storage needs. Prefer <i>SSD</i> for high QPS and leave <i>headroom</i> for indexes and temporary space. Use <i>connection pooling</i> to control concurrency before jumping to a larger machine.</p>",
